🚀 How to Run
Clone this repository or download the notebook
Open in Google Colab
Install dependencies: pymongo, sqlalchemy, psycopg2-binary, pandas, scipy
Set up your own MongoDB Atlas and Supabase connection strings
Run all cells sequentially

